rol is valuable. Passing preserves my power cards for more critical moments.\n\nReason: \nI should **pass** here. My teammate\'s ♥8 is doing its job - it will force the landlord to respond. If I play over my teammate\'s card, I\'m essentially wasting my own resources to take control from my ally. Better to let the landlord deal with it. My 2s, Queens, and especially RedJoker are too valuable to waste on beating such a low card. This preserves my strength for blocking the landlord\'s more dangerous plays later.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
